{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123677","id":4593310857,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEchciQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123677","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123677.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123677.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123677","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123677/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123677/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123677/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/89ff99de2326d99344998abff95ebec46b6033cc","number":123677,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Enter handling in project manager","user":{"login":"Ayinzhang","id":72301654,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMzAxNjU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72301654?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang","html_url":"https://github.com/Ayinzhang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayinzhang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> [!INFO]\r\n> *AI disclosure*: This contribution was authored by AI agent, on behalf of a user, to fix the project manager keyboard focus handling described in #38018.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Pressing Enter while a sidebar button such as **Remove** has keyboard focus opens the selected project instead of activating the focused button.\r\n\r\n## How does this PR solve the problem?\r\n\r\nThe project manager previously handled Enter globally in\r\n`ProjectManager::shortcut_input()`.\r\n\r\nThis moves the project-opening behavior to the focused project list item.\r\nAs a result:\r\n\r\n- Enter opens a project when a project list item is focused.\r\n- Enter submits the search box through its existing `text_submitted` handler.\r\n- Enter activates focused sidebar buttons through their normal `ui_accept`\r\n  handling.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- Focused **Remove** and pressed Enter: the removal confirmation opens.\r\n- Focused a project list item and pressed Enter: the project opens.\r\n- Focused the search box and pressed Enter: the selected project opens.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-21T15:38:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T08:56:11Z","closed_at":"2026-09-21T15:45:25Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"171566bd0c63e19cdf87088703441cf7e5bcd542","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Ayinzhang:fix-project-manager-enter-38018","ref":"fix-project-manager-enter-38018","repo":null,"sha":"89ff99de2326d99344998abff95ebec46b6033cc","user":{"login":"Ayinzhang","id":7230165